Fix AOT compatibility warnings in these files in `/tmp/sv-2bd45597a1044230900884e62c2bfcb1/before/`:

## 1. ArmOperation.cs - IL2087/IL2090 on generic parameter T

The method `IsResource<T>()` at line 96 uses `typeof(T).GetConstructor(...)` and `Activator.CreateInstance(typeof(T), ...)` which requires `[DynamicallyAccessedMembers]` on T.

Add the `NonPublicConstructors` annotation to the `T` constraint:

```csharp
private static bool IsResource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T>() where T : notnull
```

Add `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` if not already present.

## 2. GenericOperationSource.cs - IL2087 on generic parameter T

The class `GenericOperationSource<T>` uses `typeof(T)` with `ModelReaderWriter.Read(data, typeof(T))` and `Activator.CreateInstance(typeof(T), ...)`. Both require `DynamicallyAccessedMembers` on T.

Add annotation to the class generic parameter:

```csharp
internal class GenericOperationSource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.PublicConstructors | DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T> : IOperationSource<T>
```

`System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis` is already imported (line 8).

## 3. Extensions/ArmClientBuilderExtensions.cs - IL2026/IL3050

The method `AddArmClient<TBuilder, TConfiguration>` at line 27 calls `builder.RegisterClientFactory<ArmClient, ArmClientOptions>(configuration)` which is marked `[RequiresUnreferencedCode]` and `[RequiresDynamicCode]`.

Add both attributes to the method:

```csharp
[RequiresUnreferencedCode("Binding strongly typed objects to configuration values is not supported with trimming. Use the Configuration Binder Source Generator (EnableConfigurationBindingGenerator=true) instead.")]
[RequiresDynamicCode("Binding strongly typed objects to configuration values requires generating dynamic code at runtime, for example instantiating generic types.")]
public static IAzureClientBuilder<ArmClient, ArmClientOptions> AddArmClient<TBuilder, TConfiguration>(this TBuilder builder, TConfiguration configuration)
```

Add `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` if not already present.

## 4. ArmEnvironment.cs - IL2026/IL3050 from JsonSerializer.Serialize(this)

Line 80: `public override string ToString() => JsonSerializer.Serialize(this);`

Replace with manual JSON construction that doesn't use JsonSerializer:
```csharp
public override string ToString()
{
    return $"{{\"Endpoint\":\"{Endpoint}\",\"Audience\":\"{Audience}\"}}";
}
```

Do NOT add `using System.Text.Json.Serialization;`. Remove `using System.Text.Json;` only if nothing else in the file uses it.

## 5. ArmClientOptions.cs - IL2026/IL3050 from JsonSerializer.Deserialize

Line 52: `var allProfile = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, Dictionary<string, JsonElement>>>(span);`

Replace with manual JSON parsing using JsonDocument:
```csharp
var allProfile = new Dictionary<string, Dictionary<string, JsonElement>>();
using (var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(BinaryData.FromBytes(span.ToArray())))
{
    foreach (var outerProp in doc.RootElement.EnumerateObject())
